a con il flash della macchina fotografica di Rosie. Tuttavia durante la fuga la fotocamera le sfugge di mano; Skie tenta di recuperarla e viene catturata nuovamente, mentre gli altri riescono a fuggire. Nel frattempo i giocatori vengono raggiunti da Pinkus Mountbatten e dai suoi seguaci, che li invitano ad una partita contro la squadra Luce Sfavillante.","language":"it-IT"},"tagline":{"value":"化身大戦、はじまる！","language":"ja-JP"},"releaseDate":"2011-12-23","status":"Released","rating":7.3,"ratingCount":16,"genres":["Animazione","Azione"],"countries":["Japan"],"facts":{"Runtime":"91m"},"keywords":[],"networks":[],"socialLinks":{},"cast":[{"id":1247771,"name":"Yuka Terasaki","role":"Tenma Matsukaze (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hMorHtbCmbDkznBr6P71qHk2rSL.jpg"},{"id":82055,"name":"Junko Takeuchi","role":"Mamoru Endou (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zNjrblq3xS1idpCsmSl5P5eTon7.jpg"},{"id":1241467,"name":"Takashi Oohara","role":"Kyosuke Tsurugi (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fO73WizpZWmg9QO3RpQD6CXs7F0.jpg"},{"id":126286,"name":"Mitsuki Saiga","role":"Shindou Takuto (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qjRHodCBpKY8nEa4p8dZriDoil4.jpg"},{"id":1248340,"name":"Haruka Tomatsu","role":"Shinsuke Nishizono (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/geVvuA2zMGE5xzfc20aDelJSelu.jpg"},{"id":1253068,"name":"Sayaka Kitahara","role":"Aoi Sorano (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/72qZvVj7HhxeakXCN8g6xwW0Rns.jpg"},{"id":1254070,"name":"Mina","role":"Midori Seto (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3fVOuvqwzDwciRT2iVsTXybWnFg.jpg"},{"id":1247848,"name":"Chiaki Yurin","role":"Akane Yamana (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7oQWxjzRUURO27PUtC4JUg9Blr9.jpg"},{"id":1123401,"name":"Yu Kobayashi","role":"Ranmaru Kirino (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/p3OKrnliz2C8ub14Pn5pN3T8Q9B.jpg"},{"id":2385848,"name":"Ke